","value":16,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3615330","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1847286114044303","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix","summary":"Hello detectives, We have released a demo hotfix today to address some issues raised by the community. Patch Notes: Bug Fixes [*]Fixed some fonts not loading properly when switching language to Chinese and Japanese. Quality of Life [*]Added an option to remove Chromatic Abberation in the settings. Thank you for your continued support of our demo and for your feedback. Hillthorn launches 10 November Wishlist Hillthorn and Play the Demo Now! https://store.steampowered.com/app/3504050/_Hillthorn/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:58:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044303","verified_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1847286114033051","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"The Mechanics of Hillthorn","summary":"Hello detectives, Hillthorn is a dark investigation mystery told entirely through cards. The game has no dialogue and creates a unique gaming experience. We wanted to tell you a little more about how the mechanics of Hillthorn work including the Time Loop Mechanic that you have not yet experienced in the demo. No Dialogue Hillthorn having no dialogue allows the player to have a personal and unique experience. Every player will piece together the story and attribute individual elements to the cha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:00:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033051","verified_at":"2026-10-22T19:44:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1846651706691477","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hello detectives, It's Steam Next Fest time and we are so excited that Hillthorn is included with our updated demo. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45997770/b8def5daabd64e052934d8c1b69cdc18b8a5e203.jpg Hillthorn has a Launch Date If you missed it, we announced that Hillthorn will be launching on Steam, Nintendo Switch, iOS and Android on 10 November 2026 as part of The Mix Fall Game Showcase. There is not much longer to wait to conduct your full investigations at Mount Hillthorn. Wishlist Hillthorn and Play ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:01:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691477","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1846651706682584","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"Hillthorn Launches 10 November","summary":"Hello detectives, We just announced at The MIX Fall Game Showcase that Hillthorn is coming to Steam, Nintendo Switch, iOS and Android on 10 November 2026! Hillthorn is a dark investigation game where you are hired to solve the case of a missing young woman from a remote and secretive mountain community. The story and your investigations unfold entirely through cards. Can you solve this case and discover what happened to Olivia? Wishlist Hillthorn and Play the Demo Now! https://store.steampowered","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T17:45:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1846018067944325","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"The MIX Fall Game Showcase","summary":"Hello detectives, We are delighted to share that Hillthorn will be included in The Indie Exchange MIX Fall Game Showcase. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45997770/0633ee2168e6f6ef8b4ecc6a58d120835a5247c0.png Tune in for very exciting Hillthorn news! 👀 The showcase starts at 9am PT/6pm CEST on 16 October on Twitch and Youtube. Wishlist Hillthorn and Play the Demo Now! https://store.steampowered.com/app/3504050/_Hillthorn/","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T15:00:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067944325","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1846018067930753","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"LudoNarraCon 2026","summary":"Hello detectives, We are delighted to share that Hillthorn is an Official Selection for LudoNarraCon 2026! LudoNarraCon is an annual celebration of narrative games, the teams that make them and the fans who love them and we and excited to be included alongside so many incredible games. The event is live now until 15 October and includes a selection of demos and discounts that are well worth checking out: https://store.steampowered.com/sale/ludonarracon?tab=1 Wishlist Hillthorn and Play the Demo ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T17:09:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067930753","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1846018067929622","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Hello Detectives!We released a demo update today that includes new content!New Content All cinematics have been redone New Zoom Feature available in options. When activated, you can now press on a card for small duration to show a fullscreen version of it. Entering a wrong path in the Winding Trails now has improved feedbacks. Improvement to the music in the first scene of the game. Bug Fixes Fixed resolution resetting when changing screen mode. Fixed cards being dragged out of the game’s screen","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T13:13:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067929622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1844751498221802","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"The Music of Hillthorn","summary":"Hello detectives, We spoke to Antoine from Fool Moon Games about the music of Hillthorn. Q: How would you describe the music of Hillthorn? A: The music of Hillthorn is a mix of ambient analog synthesizers with carefully chosen acoustic instruments like tenor saxophone and female vocals. It has somewhat a vintage feel in many aspects, but also some modern effects and sounds to keep things diverse and surprising. Q: How important was the style of the music of Hillthorn? A: From very early in discu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T15:00:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221802","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1842212951298441","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"Hillthorn Release Date Window Announced","summary":"Hello detectives, As you might have just seen during the Future Games Show we have some news! Not only can we now confirm that Hillthorn will be coming in November 2026, we can also share that alongside Steam Hillthorn will be launching on iOS, Android and Nintendo Switch. We’re so excited to share this news with you! Wishlist Hillthorn and Play the Demo Now!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T00:18:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951298441","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1841579228665909","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"The Art of Hillthorn","summary":"Hello detectives, We caught up with Tara from Fool Moon Games to talk about the art direction of Hillthorn, the inspirations and considerations when creating a game with a story told entirely through cards. Q: How would you describe the art style of Hillthorn? A: Dramatic and stark. Q: Why did you choose this art style for the game? A: Hillthorn’s narrative and gameplay are very mysterious, and I found that the lack of dialogue gave the interactions a shadowy, almost dreamlike quality. I wanted ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T15:00:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665909","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1841579228662506","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update & More Languages","summary":"Hello detectives, We have released a demo update today that includes some new content and 11 new languages! Notes Added a short cinematic in the game’s introduction. Added new effects on some cards (look out for the radio!) Added and updated sound effects. Added more notes in the Diary as you discover the folks of Hillthorn. Added a new interaction in the Inn Room New Languages Simplified Chinese German Indonesian Japanese Korean Portuguese Spanish Italian Polish Russian Spanish (LATAM) {STEAM_C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T12:57:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228662506","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1840944183786655","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"Summer of Screams","summary":"Hello detectives, Hillthorn is included alongside a number of fantastic horror and horror-adjacent games in the Summer of Screams Event on Steam Now! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45997770/a0c691d2b072b8e3ddcab1c4e81acbfae1cdaad9.jpg The event is live now until 31 August so there is plenty of time to check out the selection of games and play a few demos (including ours!) {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45997770/4da7819faf6a005ecc880007c76e81b669479c96.jpg Hillthorn is a dark investigation game where you play as a detec","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T17:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183786655","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1840944183779912","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"Hillthorn at Gamescom","summary":"Hello detectives, We are thrilled to announce that Hillthorn will be going to Gamescom! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45997770/282f3ef3a9e18e8b71b954d3a1823964da265875.jpg You will find us on the Raw Fury booth in Hall 10.1 Aisle B-21 between 26-30 August. The Hillthorn demo will be available to play on the showfloor and we have exclusive pin badges to give to people who visit the booth and check out the demo, and they even glow in the dark! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45997770/32a17b4229e5e6b3b17f7eb45b5c5abf631a4","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-14T15:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183779912","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1838407329256939","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"What is Hillthorn?","summary":"Hello detectives, It’s been over a week since we revealed our new trailer, shared our partnership news with Raw Fury and released our updated demo. We have been so excited with the reception so far to Hillthorn! What is Hillthorn? Hillthorn is an eerie detective mystery set in a remote mountain community where it seems everyone has something to hide and you get the impression that outsiders aren’t as welcome as it might appear. There’s an unsettling feeling that does not seem to fade as you delv","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T15:00:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256939","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1836506165583314","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to Hillthorn & Updated Demo","summary":"Hello detectives, A young couple are missing; from the details you were provided when you were hired to find them it seems they were hiking somewhere remote and could have simply gotten lost... But there’s something about Mount Hillthorn and the people who live there that keep raising questions in your mind, too many unsettling questions... What has happened to this young couple, and do you have what it takes to find them? Hillthorn is an eerie detective game with an engaging and exciting story ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T12:59:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165583314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3504050-1825093633186512","game_id":"steam-3504050","kind":"announcement","title":"The Mystery Begins... with a demo!","summary":"A new case has landed on your desk. Another disappeareance. Probably a simple case, but time sensitive. Time to head to Hillthorn. To solve the case, you will have to combine clues, verbs and concepts to gather evidence. There's no prose or dialogue : Instead you'll have to use your intuition and imagination to uncover the mystery. Go on, give it a try! And don't forget to leave some feedback. Tick Tock, Investigator. Get more updatesBluesky Instagram","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-19T23:06:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825093633186512","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:28:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3504050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3504050":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3504050":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z"},"3615330":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:40Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3504050","app_id":3504050,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:18Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"94b727a2c